Third-party material in this repository keeps its own terms:

- build/src/sources/country_speeds.rs holds the default speed limits that the
  osm-legal-default-speeds project parses from the OpenStreetMap wiki's "Default speed limits"
  tables, by OpenStreetMap wiki contributors, under CC BY-SA 2.0.
- physics/tests/fixtures/cnossos_iso_tr_17534_4_direct.json holds the test-case values of
  ISO/TR 17534-4:2020 as published by NoiseModelling (Université Gustave Eiffel).
- The aircraft noise tables compiled into the programs come from EASA's Aircraft Noise and
  Performance (ANP) database, and the helicopter levels from EASA Certification Noise Levels -
  Helicopters, Issue 52, whose source is acknowledged here as its terms require.

The data the map is computed from are credited, with their licences, on the About page Data
sources (frontend/src/about/data-sources.md).
